msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/existentialOrdinalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "existentialOrdinal is functional"
msgstr "existentialOrdinal est fonctionnelle"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/existentialOrdinalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:existentialOrdinal is functional: a chase-invented gmeow:InventedWitness discharges exactly one existential head-variable of its firing rule, so it carries a single 0-based ordinal that is one of the three components of its content-addressed identity."
msgstr "Affirme sur le porteur canonique que gmeow:existentialOrdinal est fonctionnelle : un gmeow:InventedWitness inventé par la procédure de chase décharge exactement une variable de tête existentielle de sa règle de déclenchement, de sorte qu'il porte un unique ordinal à base zéro, l'une des trois composantes de son identité adressée par contenu."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingCodeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "findingCode is functional"
msgstr "findingCode est fonctionnelle"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingCodeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:findingCode is functional: a gmeow:Finding carries exactly one stable rule identifier, serving as its SARIF ruleId and the single key by which findings are grouped and suppressed."
msgstr "Affirme sur le porteur canonique que gmeow:findingCode est fonctionnelle : un gmeow:Finding porte exactement un identifiant de règle stable, servant de ruleId SARIF et de clé unique permettant de regrouper et de supprimer les constats."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingMessageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "findingMessage is functional"
msgstr "findingMessage est fonctionnelle"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingMessageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:findingMessage is functional: a gmeow:Finding carries exactly one human-readable message describing that occurrence, distinct from its single stable code."
msgstr "Affirme sur le porteur canonique que gmeow:findingMessage est fonctionnelle : un gmeow:Finding porte exactement un message lisible par un humain décrivant cette occurrence, distinct de son unique code stable."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingSeverityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "findingSeverity is functional"
msgstr "findingSeverity est fonctionnelle"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingSeverityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:findingSeverity is functional: a gmeow:Finding has exactly one verdict grade, a single gmeow:DiagnosticSeverity that is its observation result."
msgstr "Affirme sur le porteur canonique que gmeow:findingSeverity est fonctionnelle : un gmeow:Finding possède exactement un degré de verdict, un unique gmeow:DiagnosticSeverity qui constitue le résultat de son observation."

